            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure provides a system for treating acute or chronic instability of two boney structures in a patient. The system comprises: a cannulated flip button comprising a body portion, a peg extending from the body portion, a cannulation that extends between the body portion and the peg, and an opening substantially perpendicular to a long axis of the body portion. The cannulated flip button has a first orientation allowing installation through a bone hole and a second orientation preventing pulling back through the bone hole.</p>
            </abstract>
